  "disclosures": [
    "The floor is measured with the task stream switched off in the identical environment; it is the same hard lower bound at every arrival rate.",
    "Every workload point resamples real Alibaba tasks per 15-minute slot. No job shape or arrival time is invented; the transformation is seeded and recorded in each point's workload manifest.",
